    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"../query/Collation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Collation</code></a> to specify language-specific rules for string comparison, such as rules for lettercase\nand accent marks.<br/>\n<strong>NOTE:</strong> Only queries using the same <a href=\"../query/Collation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Collation</code></a> as the <a href=\"Index.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Index</code></a> actually make use of the\nindex.",
      "translation": "设置<a href=\"../query/Collation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Collation</code></a>以指定字符串比较的语言特定规则，例如字母大小写和重音符号的规则。<br/>\n<strong>注意：</strong>只有使用与<a href=\"Index.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Index</code></a>相同的<a href=\"../query/Collation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>Collation</code></a>的查询才会实际利用该索引。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"Index.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Index</code></a> definition for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/TypedPropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>property</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Direction.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Direction</code></a>",
